WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.583
The more packs you order, the less each one costs.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.417
Boxes is an imaginary packaging shop. Search by name, or by the code on each product.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:21.883
Every product has three pack prices. Choose a quantity and add it without leaving the page.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Make it 12 packs, and each pack drops to £24.50, with free delivery.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.267
The price rule runs in the browser, and again on the server, from its own data.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.350
The basket lives in the browser, and no card is taken.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:53.050
Add 12 packs and watch the price drop, at boxes.junaid.guru.
